From: XG2010G Test-2
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: airoha: enable RTL8261 SerDes tuning on XG2010G

The XG2010G uses RTL8261-family 10G PHYs at MDIO addresses 0x08 and 0x05.
Enable the board-specific host-side SerDes tuning only for those PHY nodes.

--- a/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581-gemtek-xg2010g.dts
+++ b/target/linux/airoha/dts/an7581-gemtek-xg2010g.dts
@@ -13,6 +13,18 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&mdio {
+	ethernet-phy@8 {
+		reg = <0x8>;
+		realtek,patch-rtk-serdes;
+	};
+
+	ethernet-phy@5 {
+		reg = <0x5>;
+		realtek,patch-rtk-serdes;
+	};
+};
+
 &spi_nand {
 	partitions {
 		compatible = "fixed-partitions";
